{"seq":2,"slug":"strikethrough-discount-rule","title":"划线价与折扣力度合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-claim-promo-compliance/promo-price-indication-law/strikethrough-discount-rule","wordCount":2311,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"划线价与折扣力度合规\">划线价与折扣力度合规</h1><p>前价算对了，展示还可能出错。「原价 299」这行字是一次<strong>事实陈述</strong>，它的合法性不只取决于数字正确，还取决于它被放在什么上下文里、用什么措辞、以及现价与前价的关系是否被如实表达。美国联邦贸易委员会对这类问题有一个专门的表述叫虚假原价（fictitious pricing）：如果被展示为「原价」「常规价」「厂商建议价」的数字实际上从未以该价格向公众善意提供过，这个展示本身就是欺骗性的，与它旁边的折扣数字无关（<a href=\"https://www.ftc.gov/business-guidance/resources/advertising-faqs-guide-small-business\">FTC Advertising FAQs: A Guide for Small Business</a>）。欧盟的定义式规则给了你一个明确的前价，但展示环节仍然有大量可被认定为误导的空间——折扣率算错、倒计时造假、参考价措辞含混。</p>\n<p>这一篇只讲展示：划线价的形态与措辞、折扣率的计算与舍入、时间压力型表述、以及「永远在打折」这一整类幻觉定价的识别。前价怎么取数见 <a href=\"omnibus-prior-price-rule\">Omnibus 原价标示（前30天最低价）</a>；各市场对折扣力度的额外限制见 <a href=\"country-price-marketing-rule\">各国促销价格标示矩阵</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>划线价（strikethrough price）是营销上最有效的价格表达形式，也是最容易被误用的。它的合法性建立在一条隐含断言上：<strong>这个被划掉的数字曾经是真的</strong>。因此展示层面的检查可以归纳成一个三段式——前价是否真实存在过、折扣率是否算对、措辞是否让消费者产生超出事实的预期。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[展示请求&lt;br/&gt;offer + market + 前价 + 现价] --&gt; B{前价真实存在过?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| X[拦截: 虚假原价]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C{前价 &gt; 现价?}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| Y[拦截: 无实际降价]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[计算折扣率 r]&#10;  D --&gt; E{r 的舍入是否夸大?}&#10;  E --&gt;|夸大| F[改正或降级显示]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G{有倒计时/时间压力?}&#10;  G --&gt;|有| H{倒计时真实且不重置?}&#10;  H --&gt;|否| I[拦截: 虚假紧迫感]&#10;  H --&gt;|是| J[允许展示]&#10;  G --&gt;|无| J\">graph TD\n  A[展示请求&lt;br/&gt;offer + market + 前价 + 现价] --&gt; B{前价真实存在过?}\n  B --&gt;|否| X[拦截: 虚假原价]\n  B --&gt;|是| C{前价 &gt; 现价?}\n  C --&gt;|否| Y[拦截: 无实际降价]\n  C --&gt;|是| D[计算折扣率 r]\n  D --&gt; E{r 的舍入是否夸大?}\n  E --&gt;|夸大| F[改正或降级显示]\n  E --&gt;|否| G{有倒计时/时间压力?}\n  G --&gt;|有| H{倒计时真实且不重置?}\n  H --&gt;|否| I[拦截: 虚假紧迫感]\n  H --&gt;|是| J[允许展示]\n  G --&gt;|无| J</pre><p>第一段断言（真实存在过）在欧盟由前价计算直接满足，在美国需要独立证据。第二段（前价高于现价）看似显然，但前面讲过连续促销会让它不成立。第三段（措辞不夸大）是纯展示层的问题，也是本篇的重点。</p>\n<p>第二件事是<strong>参考价的合法类别</strong>。被划掉的数字可以是多种东西，法律待遇不同：真实前价（受 Article 6a 约束）、厂商建议零售价（MSRP，只有在实际以此价格销售过时才能作为「原价」）、竞品价（比较广告规则约束）、以及「同类商品典型价」。把 MSRP 当作原价展示，在商品从未以该价出售过时构成虚假原价。工程上的做法是给参考价加类型标签，展示时按类型套不同的措辞模板与证据要求，而不是统一写「原价」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参考价类型</th>\n<th>措辞示例</th>\n<th>证据要求</th>\n<th>常见误用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>真实前价</td>\n<td>原价 / 降价前</td>\n<td>价格流水（Article 6a 窗口）</td>\n<td>用窗口外价格代替</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>厂商建议价</td>\n<td>建议零售价 / RRP</td>\n<td>厂商价目表 + 实际销售记录</td>\n<td>直接写作「原价」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>竞品价</td>\n<td>竞品 X 售价</td>\n<td>可核验的取数快照与时间</td>\n<td>无快照、无可比性说明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同类典型价</td>\n<td>同类商品均价</td>\n<td>可复现的统计口径</td>\n<td>口径不明、样本不可查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会员专享价</td>\n<td>会员价 / 非会员价</td>\n<td>会员价格确实实施</td>\n<td>用未实施的会员价虚增对比</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"折扣率的计算与舍入\">折扣率的计算与舍入</h2><p>折扣率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 的基本定义是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>prior</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>current</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>prior</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = \\frac{P_{\\text{prior}} - P_{\\text{current}}}{P_{\\text{prior}}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">prior</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">prior</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">current</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>计算本身简单，出问题的是<strong>舍入方向与措辞的耦合</strong>。两个真实存在的风险：其一，<code>round()</code> 的银行家舍入会让 24.5% 显示成 24%，而商家往往预期向上；其二，任何把折扣率向上取整的做法都在夸大——23.4% 显示成 24% 已经是一次不实陈述，显示成 25% 则更严重。稳妥规则是<strong>折扣率一律向下取整到展示精度</strong>，并且展示精度与金额精度分离：百分比通常取整，金额保留两位小数或按市场货币的最小单位。</p>\n<p>第二类风险来自<strong>基数选择</strong>。折扣可以按前价算（「立减 30%」），也可以按现价算（「多付 50% 才买得到原价」），两者数字差别很大。措辞必须与基数一致：「降价 40%」的基数是前价，「这是原价的六折」的基数也是前价，而「相当于省下 40%」在口语中常被理解为基数现价。测试上可以设一条不变量：展示的折扣率必须等于按前价计算的、向下取整的比率，任何偏离都进复核队列。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"function discountRate(prior, current, decimals = 0) {&#10;  if (!(prior &gt; 0) || current &gt;= prior) return null;&#10;  const raw = ((prior - current) / prior) * 100;&#10;  const f = 10 ** decimals;&#10;  return Math.floor(raw * f) / f;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function assertDisplayable(offer, rate) {&#10;  const issues = [];&#10;  if (rate === null) issues.push(&#39;NO_REAL_DISCOUNT&#39;);&#10;  if (offer.referenceKind === &#39;msrp&#39; &amp;&amp; !offer.everSoldAtMsrp) {&#10;    issues.push(&#39;MSRP_AS_ORIGINAL&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;  if (offer.countdown &amp;&amp; offer.countdownResets &gt; 0) {&#10;    issues.push(&#39;RESETTING_COUNTDOWN&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;  return issues;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> discountRate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">prior</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">current</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">decimals</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(prior </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prior) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> raw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ((prior </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prior) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> **</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> decimals;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">floor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(raw </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> assertDisplayable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">offer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> issues</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) issues.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'NO_REAL_DISCOUNT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (offer.referenceKind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'msrp'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">offer.everSoldAtMsrp) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    issues.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'MSRP_AS_ORIGINAL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (offer.countdown </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> offer.countdownResets </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    issues.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RESETTING_COUNTDOWN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> issues;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>countdownResets</code> 这一项值得单说。倒计时本身不违法——「本活动 24 小时后结束」是正常商业表达。但如果同一活动在同一商品上把倒计时反复重置，消费者会持续处于「马上就没了」的紧迫感中，这构成误导。美国的规则把它归入欺骗性紧迫感（deceptive urgency），欧盟在《不公平商业行为指令》的附件里也有对应的黑名单条目（例如以虚假的限时声明诱导交易）。系统层面能做的很直接：把倒计时的起止时刻作为数据落库，统计同一 offer 上的重置次数，超过阈值就拦。</p>\n<h3 id=\"措辞与语境\">措辞与语境</h3><p>同一句「限时特惠」放在不同上下文里含义不同；法律看的从来不是词，而是<strong>消费者合理理解成什么</strong>。三种高频误用值得单独设检查。</p>\n<p><strong>绝对化用语与无依据的比较。</strong> 「全网最低价」「史上最低」不只是文案问题——在没有可验证的全量比价依据时，它同时是比较广告与虚假宣传。这一类的判定规则在 <a href=\"../advertising-claim-rule/comparative-advertising-condition\">比较广告的合法条件</a> 里展开，本篇只在展示层设一条前置检查：出现全量范围的绝对化表述时，要求引用一份有效期内、口径明确的比价快照。</p>\n<p><strong>拆分价格的隐藏。</strong> 把必付的运费、服务费、包装费排除在展示价之外，让实际支付显著高于展示价，在许多市场被认定为误导性遗漏。这不属于折扣力度问题，但属于同一类「让消费者低估真实成本」的做法，展示层应要求「现价」字段包含全部必付项，附加费用单独列示。</p>\n<p><strong>价格对比的时间错位。</strong> 用三个月前的高价当参照、或用竞品在另一配置下的价格做对比，都属于「参照系不可比」。可操作的检查是把参照价的时间戳与配置标识一起落库，并与当前 offer 的配置做等价比对；不一致时不允许直接展示，只能改为说明性表述。</p>\n<h2 id=\"幻觉定价的识别\">幻觉定价的识别</h2><p><strong>幻觉定价</strong>（illusory pricing）的典型形态是：商品几乎全年处于促销态，标准价只在极短时间出现，甚至根本不出现；促销价其实是正常售价。它为什么被禁，可以从前面已建立的两个事实直接推出：前价是窗口内最低价，所以在一个持续促销的商品上，前价会收敛到促销价附近；这时展示的「折扣」在数学上就是零或接近零。所以幻觉定价的检测不需要新的法律概念，只需要<strong>长期跟踪折扣的持续性</strong>。</p>\n<p>可落地的三个指标：其一，促销天数占比（过去 180 天内处于任何促销态的天数比例），超过某个阈值即标记；其二，前价与标准价的偏离度，当前价长期低于标称标准价而标准价几乎不出现时告警；其三，折扣率的稳定性——如果同一商品连续多期都恰好是「五折」，这个数字极可能不是计算出来的而是设定的。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE promo_display_log (&#10;  id             BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  offer_id       BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  market         CHAR(2) NOT NULL,&#10;  channel        TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  shown_at       TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  prior_price    NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  current_price  NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  reference_kind TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  discount_rate  NUMERIC(5,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  countdown_end  TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  evidence_ref   TEXT,&#10;  rule_version   TEXT NOT NULL&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_pdl_offer_time&#10;  ON promo_display_log (offer_id, market, shown_at DESC);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> promo_display_log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  offer_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  shown_at       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  prior_price    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  current_price  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reference_kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  discount_rate  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  countdown_end  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_ref   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_version   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_pdl_offer_time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> promo_display_log (offer_id, market, shown_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这张展示流水有两个用途：对外是留痕，能回答「某日某市场展示的前价是多少、依据哪一版规则」；对内是幻觉定价检测的输入，把 <code>countdown_end</code> 的重置次数与 <code>discount_rate</code> 的分布按 offer 聚合就能看出异常。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>划线价是一次事实断言，合法性三段式：前价真实存在过、前价严格大于现价、措辞不产生超出事实的预期。</li>\n<li>参考价必须带类型标签（真实前价 / 厂商建议价 / 竞品价 / 同类典型价），不同类型套不同措辞与证据要求，MSRP 不得直接写「原价」。</li>\n<li>折扣率一律向下取整到展示精度，基数必须与前价的措辞一致；展示值与按前价计算的向下取整比率不等即进复核。</li>\n<li>倒计时合法但不可重置；同一活动反复重置倒计时构成欺骗性紧迫感。</li>\n<li>幻觉定价不需要新概念：前价收敛到促销价时折扣在数学上就是零，用促销天数占比、前价与标准价偏离度、折扣率稳定性三个指标就能识别。</li>\n<li>展示流水必须记录当时使用的前价、参考价类型与规则版本，它是第四章 <a href=\"../claim-governance-risk/promo-compliance-monitor\">促销合规监控与巡检</a> 的核查基准。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"划线价与折扣力度合规","id":"划线价与折扣力度合规"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"折扣率的计算与舍入","id":"折扣率的计算与舍入"},{"level":3,"text":"措辞与语境","id":"措辞与语境"},{"level":2,"text":"幻觉定价的识别","id":"幻觉定价的识别"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Omnibus 原价标示（前30天最低价）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-claim-promo-compliance/promo-price-indication-law/omnibus-prior-price-rule"},"next":{"title":"各国促销价格标示矩阵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-claim-promo-compliance/promo-price-indication-law/country-price-marketing-rule"}}